<%# @user, @token, @expires_in, @verify_url are set by the mailer %>
<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p>Thanks for joining Beach Volleyball Project! Please verify your email address by clicking the link below:</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @verify_url %>">Verify my email address</a>
</p>

<p>This link expires in <%= @expires_in.in_hours == 1 ? "1 hour" : "#{@expires_in.in_hours} hours" %>.</p>

<%# The raw token is what makes the link work — the digest is what's stored on the user.
    Never include the raw token in plain text outside the link itself. %>

<p>If you didn't create an account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

<p>— Beach Volleyball Project Team</p>
